  "description": "Fish 自建 DSH 插件全家桶聚合包：一键插入十四个插件的插件行 —— 十一个本仓库子包（approval-guide / git-sync / settings-nav-order / visual-companion / skill-lens-fish / task-board-fish / git-graph-fish / ssh-fish / usage-fish / session-archive-fish / video-preview-fish）与三个外部补充包（agent-teams / better-reasoning-effort / our-free-model-fish）。",
